..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
.......wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww........
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
..................w..................
.....wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww...
.....wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww...

[build]
fill 0 240 320 256 bedrock
fill 0 100 10 240 bedrock
fill 310 100 320 240 bedrock
fill 10 130 310 240 water
body 80 112 230 115 wood

[expect]
after 1: bodies == 2
after 200: count water in 0 0 320 124 <= 6
after 400: count water in 0 0 320 124 <= 6
after 600: count water in 0 0 320 124 <= 6
after 600: count water in 0 0 320 256 >= 32900
